- SE = sqrt( SSR/(n-2) / Sxx ).
- pair_orders: p_i = ln(e_i/e_{i+1}) / ln(dr_i/dr_{i+1}) = log2 ratio since ratio 2.
- pair_half_range = (max-min)/2.
- median estimator: all pairwise slopes over all i<j: (y_j-y_i)/(x_j-x_i) → median. With 4 points, 6 pairs.
- Theil–Sen = median pairwise slope. I'll call it `robust_median_pairwise_order`.

